    "name": "dialog_loc_bigapple_the_big_apple",
    "description": "Dialogi przypisane do lokacji \"The Big Apple\" (waa: bigapple).",
    "status": "done",
    "count": 14
  },
  "strings": {
    "Ahem": {
      "pl": "Ekhem",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_intro.theydid"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "As you reach the center of the clearing, you are simultaneously struck with a profound awe and a terrible stench as you discover the largest road apple you've ever seen.": {
      "pl": "Gdy docierasz do środka polany, jednocześnie ogarniają cię głęboki podziw i straszliwy smród — odkrywasz największe „drogowe jabłko”, jakie kiedykolwiek widziałeś.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_intro.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Clean it up [shovel]": {
      "pl": "Posprzątaj [łopata]",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_bigapple.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It doesn't smell any better up close.": {
      "pl": "Z bliska nie pachnie lepiej.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_bigapple.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It's almost gone now.": {
      "pl": "Prawie już zniknęło.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_bigapple.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It's quite a bit smaller than it was before.": {
      "pl": "Jest sporo mniejsze niż wcześniej.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_bigapple.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It's smaller than it was before.": {
      "pl": "Jest mniejsze niż wcześniej.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_bigapple.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "It's way smaller than it was before.": {
      "pl": "Jest o wiele mniejsze niż wcześniej.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_bigapple.popup"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Keep digging": {
      "pl": "Kop dalej",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_bigapple.dig",
        "data.json:scripts.daveyard_davegrave.dig2"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Oh, you're a poet, are you?  Okay then, @mr@ Fancy-Pants Big City Poet.  Write me a poem about this.": {
      "pl": "O, jesteś poetą, tak? No dobrze, @mr@ Wypasiony Wielkomiejski Poeto. Napisz mi wiersz o tym.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_intro.theydid"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "They...  They should've sent a poet.": {
      "pl": "Powinni... powinni wysłać poetę.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_intro.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "Yeah, they should have": {
      "pl": "Ta, powinni byli",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_intro.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You can't even imagine how this got here.  Was it... a giant horse?  Was it two hundred normal-sized horses acting collaboratively?": {
      "pl": "Nawet nie wyobrażasz sobie, jak to tu trafiło. Czy to... olbrzymi koń? Czy dwieście normalnych koni działających wspólnie?",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_intro.start"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    },
    "You make a little dent in it.": {
      "pl": "Robisz w tym małe wgniecenie.",
      "contexts": [
        "data.json:scripts.bigapple_bigapple.dig"
      ],
      "category": "dialog"
    }
  }
}
